      "attestations": [
        {
          "text": "YEN Yen 嚴衍 (T. 永思, H. 午庭, 拙道人), 1574–1645, historian, was a native of Chia-ting, Kiangsu. When he was forty-one sui he began a serious study of Ssŭ-ma Kuang's 資治通鑑 Tzŭ-chih t'ung-chien (\"Comprehensive Mirror to Aid in Government\"), a chronological history of China (completed in 1084) which treats the period from 403 B.",
